  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "化身不死Raid Boss，每次死亡都让下一轮更强",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "As the unkillable embodiment of chaos, death means nothing to you as your soul is permanently tied to this land of mortals! With each new life, you gain more power, and each cycle opens up new possibilities to grow stronger.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2518630/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "在格子战场组合元素，探索18种连锁互动",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Navigate the battlefield using a tile-based system, employing various primordial elements and combine them into potent interactions. Discover all 18 possible tile interactions and tailor your build to your preferred style of play, destroying your enemies with style!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2518630/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "三阶段Boss解锁24种能力，最多选四种拼出专属机制",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "As the Chaos Incarnate , you possess 3 Phases . The road to power means unlocking your latent \"Boss Mechanics\" . These mechanics work across distinct phases, with 24 unique powers attainable through in-game achievements . Combine up to 4 \"Boss Mechanics\" to craft your personalized Raid Boss .",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2518630/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
